{"version":3,"term":{"cols":100,"rows":30,"type":"xterm-256color"},"timestamp":1791840230,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"asciiverse/adventures/stories/stage/savoir-faire/savoir-faire","env":{"LANG":"C.UTF-8","COLORTERM":"truecolor","TERM":"xterm-256color"}}
[0.013, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[39;49m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[4d\u001b[37m\u001b[40mThe beautiful life is always damned, they say. As for you, you've overexpended yourself: fifteen\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "years of prominence, champagne, carriage rides in the Tuileries, having your name whispered behind\r\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "manicured hands, getting elegant ladies out of elegant fixes -- and you're \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[37m\u001b[40min debt\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[23m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m. Bound by oath\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "and honor to a pack of scoundrels. Your father, old peasant that he was, could have warned you\r\u001b[8dagainst their type.\r\u001b[10dYou'd hoped to find the Count at home; your original plan was to ask him for an advance on the money\u001b[11;1Hyou expect to earn on your estate in a month or two. But according to the local population, the\r\u001b[12dCount hasn't been home in months, and Marie, who was in residence until recently, has vanished as\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "well. \"No one around the big house now,\" says one of the peasant women tersely. \"Even turned off the\u001b[14;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "cook, they did.\"\r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "But you need the money at once; if you return to Paris without it, your creditors are unlikely to be\u001b[17;1Hforgiving. So you walked over the fields anyway, and got in through the gap in the kitchen garden\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "wall. You will just have to find what you can.\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mSavoir-Faire\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mAn interactive search for loot. Copyright Emily Short 2002-4.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "Type HELP if you have not played this game before, even if you are familiar with IF.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 8 / Serial number 040205 / Inform v6.15 Library 6/10\r\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mKitchen Garden\r\u001b[30d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m[MORE]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.505, "o", "\u001b[1;29r\u001b[29;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[8S\u001b[1;30r\u001b[1;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m Kitchen Garden                                                          Score: 0     Moves: 1      \u001b[22;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mWest is the wall of the kitchen. Most of the space along the wall is planted with herbs -- bay,\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "parsley, stalks of mint -- left of the open doorway. To its right is only a drainage ditch, catching\u001b[24;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "the outflow of a pipe that comes through the wall.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "In one corner of the plot is the well, drilled many deep feet; in another is the antique sundial.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "A tangle of climbing roses covers almost completely the wall and door of a shed to the southeast.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b[K"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
