[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m3\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mA sturdy old sundial, its bronze weathered green. Unlike various tawdry sundials you have\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "encountered in your life, it has a firmly-attached gnomon that is unlikely to come off in times of\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "trouble.\r\u001b[30d>"]
