[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mWest is the wall of the kitchen. Most of the space along the wall is planted with herbs -- bay,\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.001, "o", "parsley, stalks of mint -- left of the open doorway. To its right is only a drainage ditch, catching\u001b[24;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "the outflow of a pipe that comes through the wall.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "In one corner of the plot is the well, drilled many deep feet; in another is the antique sundial.\r\u001b[28dA tangle of climbing roses covers almost completely the wall and door of a shed to the southeast.\r\u001b[30d>"]
